Usage: xnvme qublk del [<args>]

Delete a ublk device left behind by a killed server

Where <args> include:

  [ --dev-id NUM ]              ; Use given 'NUM' as device identifier
  [ --help ]                    ; Show usage / help

See 'xnvme qublk --help' for other commands

qublk - ublk server backed by xNVMe -- ver: {major: 0, minor: 7, patch: 5, vcs: 'be83e57'}
